      "writtenOn": "2021-05-19T21:16:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would you think about instead running this as a little state machine like the hard reset processing?  We don\u0027t generally add new states outside the spec, and as such end up with little PD related state machines hiding in the TC.  I\u0027m not saying it\u0027s perfect...\n\nI suppose the related and mostly tangential item we could discuss long-term would be whether we actually want to make the DPM handle these things.  Though honestly for things like this with very specific timings, I find it weird they\u0027re nebulously spec\u0027d into the DPM instead of being put into defined layer states.",
      "revId": "cee15fe67da345309eddb23c85c3f63d5fe2c8e7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
