        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-19T21:16:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This might sound like a stupid question, but do we have circuitry set up to do this?  I know we run the SS lines through the muxes, but I thought I\u0027d only seen D+/D- going through protection ICs.  Though maybe it\u0027s different for Volteer with TCSS",
      "revId": "cee15fe67da345309eddb23c85c3f63d5fe2c8e7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
