      "lineNbr": 3570,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-10T22:24:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per discussion with Intel, putting the TCSS mux in a disconnect state disconnects D+/D-. I can\u0027t speak to other USB solutions.\n\nI don\u0027t think we have a way to disconnect the Rx lines independently of Tx, as this process describes. (Why?) Hopefully that\u0027s not important.",
      "parentUuid": "df0fd08a_ff69624e",
      "revId": "cee15fe67da345309eddb23c85c3f63d5fe2c8e7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
